# An allowlist: ignore everything, then re-include only what the Dagster image
# runs. A denylist lets any new local file into the image unnoticed, including
# secrets (.env), editor and agent settings, and internal notes; with an
# allowlist, a file reaches the image only when it is named here.
*

# What `uv sync` needs to install the locked dependencies and the project.
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!.python-version

# What the refresh, the upstream check and the restore script run and read.
!dagster.yaml
!src/
!dbt/
!data/
!scripts/
# Bundled into each open data archive by scripts/export_open_data.py.
!LICENSE-DATA
!docs/DATA_CONTRACT.md

# Re-excluded inside the directories above. dbt's target and logs are rebuilt
# in the image (the Dockerfile parses the project); raw inputs are
# licence-fetched and bind-mounted at run time, never baked in.
dbt/target/
dbt/logs/
dbt/dbt_packages/
dbt/.user.yml
data/raw/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.egg-info/
